     2333   method public logical CheckNotMarkUtd
     2334    (input idb-num  as integer,
     2335     input idoc-id  as integer):
     2336     define buffer utd-lines             for ub.utd-lines.
     2337     for each utd-lines where utd-lines.db-num eq idb-num
     2338                          and utd-lines.doc-id eq idoc-id
